AltoReferralWhitelistAdapter::setReferralWhitelist
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when setting address to whitelisted true
    │   ├── it should set referral whitelist mapping to true
    │   └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event
    ├── when setting address to whitelisted false
    │   ├── it should set referral whitelist mapping to false
    │   ├── when payment token share receiver is not zero
    │   │   ├── it should reset payment token share receiver to zero
    │   │   └── it should emit PaymentTokenShareReceiverSet event with zero address
    │   ├── when payment token share receiver is already zero
    │   │   └── it should not emit PaymentTokenShareReceiverSet event
    │   └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event
    ├── when updating whitelist status from false to true
    │   ├── it should update referral whitelist mapping
    │   └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event
    ├── when updating whitelist status from true to false
    │   ├── it should update referral whitelist mapping
    │   ├── when address has payment token share receiver set (non-zero)
    │   │   ├── it should reset payment token share receiver to zero
    │   │   └── it should emit PaymentTokenShareReceiverSet event with zero address
    │   ├── when address has no payment token share receiver set (zero)
    │   │   └── it should not emit PaymentTokenShareReceiverSet event
    │   └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event
    └── when setting whitelist for multiple addresses
        ├── it should set referral whitelist mapping for each address
        ├── when removing addresses from whitelist
        │   ├── when removed address has payment token share receiver set (non-zero)
        │   │   ├── it should reset payment token share receiver to zero
        │   │   └── it should emit PaymentTokenShareReceiverSet event
        │   ├── when removed address has no payment token share receiver set (zero)
        │   │   └── it should not emit PaymentTokenShareReceiverSet event
        │   └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event for each removed address
        └── it should emit ReferralWhitelistSet event for each address
